      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756792313311,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Both sentinel has their own retention settings\n- Both datalakes has their own retention settings\n- Secondary sentinel users not allowed to see logs in primary sentinel or it's datalake",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Both sentinel has their own retention settings\n- Both datalakes has their own retention settings\n- Secondary sentinel users not allowed to see logs in primary sentinel or it's datalake",
